OL,3,ASaudi Arabia urged to spare man
OL,4,Asentenced to death over Facebook post
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I plead for mercy for the wrongs
OL,7,Fcommitted by my son. Please forgive him
OL,8,Fand send him back to us."
OL,10,FSpeaking through tears, Rasamanickam
OL,11,FYogalakshmi made a desperate plea for
OL,12,Fthe life of her eldest son, Anojan
OL,13,FSivarasa. The 24-year-old migrant
OL,14,Fworker is facing the death penalty in
OL,15,FSaudi Arabia after an appellate court
OL,16,Ffound him guilty of blasphemy against
OL,17,FIslam and the Prophet Muhammad over a
OL,18,Fcomment he made on Facebook.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
